WEBVTT

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.469
(Video) Who knows what this is?

00:11:03.493 --> 00:11:04.564
Child: Potatoes.

00:11:04.588 --> 00:11:07.176
Jamie Oliver: Potato?
So, you think these are potatoes?

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.421
Do you know what that is?

00:11:08.734 --> 00:11:09.938
Do you know what that is?

00:11:09.962 --> 00:11:10.977
Child: Broccoli?

00:11:11.001 --> 00:11:13.457
JO: What about this? Our good old friend.

00:11:13.481 --> 00:11:14.641
Child: Celery.

00:11:14.665 --> 00:11:16.609
JO: No. What do you think this is?

00:11:16.633 --> 00:11:18.117
Child: Onion.
JO: Onion? No.

00:11:18.141 --> 00:11:20.547
JO: Immediately you
get a really clear sense

00:11:20.571 --> 00:11:23.791
of "Do the kids know anything
about where food comes from?"

00:11:23.815 --> 00:11:25.792
Who knows what that is? Child: Uh, pear?

00:11:25.816 --> 00:11:28.244
JO: What do you think this is?
Child: I don't know.

00:11:28.268 --> 00:11:30.252
JO: If the kids don't know what stuff is,